{"id":1814203,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-01T17:22:50.001Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/v93OLCYZ3MSpyWhP7SdMQScqS6C.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1814203,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["ID"],"original_language":"id","original_title":"Appinru","overview":"In a remote place embraced by morning fog and steep uphill roads, stands a simple wooden learning house. There, a group of young educators from the Appinru Community show up every week. Traveling long distances amidst busy college schedules, they choose to keep returning and greeting the children who patiently wait.  ​Through brief yet meaningful meetings, letter by letter is read and simple dreams begin to be sown. This documentary captures the traces of loyalty and sincerity of the educators in nurturing hope amidst various limitations. Because in the end, dedication is not about how big the stage is, but about the courage to keep showing up and choosing never to stop giving.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/pYL4WdETpUKVCoQxPDcI2lkQGSv.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2025-11-03","revenue":0,"runtime":12,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Indonesian","iso_639_1":"id","name":"Bahasa indonesia"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Appinru: A Light Kept Alive","video":true,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6591926,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Abdullah Fauzan bin Abdurra","original_name":"Abdullah Fauzan bin Abdurra","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":17,"character":"Informant","credit_id":"6ae70e75bffedee5b5f1b26d","order":0}],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":5900882,"known_for_department":"Camera","name":"Muh. Fatur Rahman","original_name":"Muh. Fatur Rahman","popularity":0.2563,"profile_path":"/yg8YtiKznosqhDYDV3kiIDSFYF1.jpg","credit_id":"6ae70adff9357a3c